more efficient, right?

00:01:13.523 --> 00:01:15.852
So, we'll do that.

00:01:15.852 --> 00:01:18.062
I'm looking forward to it.

00:01:18.062 --> 00:01:20.313
Should be really, 
really productive.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.284
Got a bunch of my team here.

00:01:22.284 --> 00:01:24.220
Kim Garcia from 
Vayner Experience,

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:25.683
crushed it.

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:30.491
Excited about our Experience
Division of events that we put

00:01:30.491 --> 00:01:34.779
on and events that we activate
for clients and it should just

00:01:34.779 --> 00:01:37.560
