Alex Castlin looks homeless.

00:10:25.045 --> 00:10:26.349
We've established that.

00:10:26.349 --> 00:10:28.950
Ryan Harwood looks like 
he ate a good amount tonight.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:30.734
- Oh!

00:10:30.734 --> 00:10:32.432
- We've made some stuff done.

00:10:32.432 --> 00:10:34.565
Bunch of the peeps.

00:10:34.565 --> 00:10:35.896
Productive meetings.

00:10:35.896 --> 00:10:37.201
Ryan, productive?

